From: chelovechishee <261262090+chelovechishee@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH 12/41] cpufreq on Exynos 7885 through ACPM: mailbox, ACPM
 plugins, ACPM clocks, read-only TMU, OPP/thermal DT; keep S-Boot ECT

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
